@trading_service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5071
@adminToken = your-jwt-with-role-Admin

### Discounts — public list (Guest / Customer / Staff)
GET {{trading_service_HostAddress}}/api/discounts?search=&status=running&productId=
Accept: application/json

### Discounts — by id
GET {{trading_service_HostAddress}}/api/discounts/1
Accept: application/json

### Discounts — create (Admin only)
POST {{trading_service_HostAddress}}/api/discounts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tet sale",
  "discountPercent": 10,
  "startDate": "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "isActive": true,
  "productId": 1,
  "createdByAdminId": null
}

###
